From f4d239f061b9b8eb9d4ab7f3d59d96b12444a60d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Md Arif <111168803+sabamdarif@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 12:30:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] 0045-preload-gtk3-vclplug-for-bionic-rtti-dynamic-cast

The gtk3 VCL plugin is dlopen'd (never DT_NEEDED), so Bionic gives its
weak vague-linkage weld::*/Gtk* type_info symbols local copies even with
libsofficeapp.so preloaded. dynamic_cast matches type_info by pointer
identity on libc++abi, so casts in startup-closure libs against objects
constructed in the plugin fail: svt::ToolboxController::initialize's
dynamic_cast<weld::Toolbar*>(TransportAsXWindow::getWidget()) returned
null, leaving m_pToolbar unset (release build compiles out the assert),
and framework::ImageOrientationController's ctor then dereferenced the
null VCLUnoHelper::GetWindow(getParent()) result in the !m_pToolbar
fallback -> SIGSEGV (null + 0x8, vcl::Window::AddEventListener) during
sidebar creation ~1s after opening any document.

Fix: add libvclplug_gtk3lo.so to the LD_PRELOAD set in soffice.sh so the
plugin joins the startup global group and its RTTI unifies with the rest.
Verified on device: Calc opens, sidebar renders, no crash.
---
 desktop/scripts/soffice.sh | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/desktop/scripts/soffice.sh b/desktop/scripts/soffice.sh
index b3f5852bb..11ec1dd32 100755
--- a/desktop/scripts/soffice.sh
+++ b/desktop/scripts/soffice.sh
@@ -69,7 +69,16 @@ cd "$sd_cwd" || exit $?
 # symbols, but LD_PRELOAD does. With this, every component binds the
 # exception type_info base chain to libsofficeapp's copies and typed
 # catches match again.
-LD_PRELOAD="$sd_prog/libsofficeapp.so${LD_PRELOAD:+:$LD_PRELOAD}"
+#
+# libvclplug_gtk3lo.so must be preloaded too: it is dlopen'd as a VCL
+# plugin (not DT_NEEDED anywhere), so it sits outside libsofficeapp's
+# startup closure and its weld::* / gtk widget classes get their own local
+# type_info copies. dynamic_cast also matches by type_info pointer
+# identity, so e.g. svt::ToolboxController::initialize's
+# dynamic_cast<weld::Toolbar*> on a GtkInstanceToolbar returns null and
+# the sidebar toolbar setup crashes on a null vcl::Window
+# (ImageOrientationController ctor) as soon as a document opens.
+LD_PRELOAD="$sd_prog/libsofficeapp.so:$sd_prog/libvclplug_gtk3lo.so${LD_PRELOAD:+:$LD_PRELOAD}"
 export LD_PRELOAD
 
 # linked build needs additional settings
